# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Discord Bot Configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

# Your bot token — found in the Discord Developer Portal
# https://discord.com/developers/applications → Your App → Bot → Token
# Your bot's Application ID — found in General Information
# https://discord.com/developers/applications → Your App → General Information → Application ID

# The ID of the channel where feedback submissions will be sent
# Right-click a channel in Discord → Copy Channel ID (requires Developer Mode)
# Enable Developer Mode: User Settings → Advanced → Developer Mode
